
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GitHub Pages branch.
#
# Everything the app needs at runtime is committed and served from the repo
# root: index.html, Engine-V2/, shared/ (decks, css, js), docs/rules.pdf,
# docs/card-details.json, LICENSE and NOTICE. Pages publishes the whole root,
# so keep that list deliberate - anything committed here is also downloadable
# from the public site.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# --- OS / editor ---
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
*.swo
.vscode/

# --- Local runtime data ---
# The Python API server (gone from this branch) used this tree for scenarios,
# uploads and the Custom Cards deck envelope. The static build keeps user
# content in the browser instead (IndexedDB - see shared/js/local-api.js).
data/

# --- Contributor notes (deliberately not published) ---
AGENTS.md

# --- Developer docs: ship the data and the rule book, not the prose ---
docs/*
!docs/*.pdf
!docs/*.json
# git will not descend into a directory excluded by docs/*, so a !*.json
# negation on its own misses the nested detection files.
!docs/detection/

# --- Dependencies (this branch has no build step) ---
node_modules/

# --- Logs ---
logs/
*.log